%% Manual Land Coordinate Entry Sequence
sequenceDiagram
    title Manual Land Coordinate Entry - CharAI Backend

    actor Farmer
    participant Frontend
    participant "Backend API" as API
    participant "GeoData Processor" as Geo

    note over Farmer,Geo: User manually enters coordinates
    Farmer->>Frontend: Input coordinates
    Frontend->>API: POST /land-coordinates
    API->>Geo: Validate & format coordinates
    Geo-->>API: Return GeoJSON data
    API-->>Frontend: Display interactive map
    Frontend-->>Farmer: Show field boundaries